node_modules
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.git
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
# Explicit **-anchored rule, since a bare `.env.*` above only reliably
# excludes root-level matches under Docker's ignore-pattern semantics -
# apps/web/.env.local (host-local URLs) must never reach an image; it would
# take precedence over the real values passed via docker-compose environment.
**/.env.local
